See `Vendor/libgpod/COPYING` and the per-file headers in `Vendor/libgpod/src/`.

libgpod is statically linked into the application. Under LGPL 2.1 section 6,
anyone distributing a compiled binary of this application must also provide the
source or object files needed to relink it against a modified libgpod.
Distributing this repository's complete source satisfies that requirement;
shipping a prebuilt .app or disk image on its own does not.
